The Nearby Wi-Fi Report reads the output of lswifi, Josh Schmelzle's open-source
Wi-Fi scanner (BSD-3-Clause, https://github.com/joshschmelzle/lswifi). lswifi
itself is not included here. wdutil is part of macOS and netsh is part of
Windows; these pages read their text output and run nothing on your computer.
